public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My favorite part of @Grok @Bot https://t.co/hG0Pq1M5MM", "url": "https://x.com/michiesneaks/status/2123044893056462913"}, {"author_id": "1518906582892953600", "created_at": "2026-11-18T13:25:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2123044871137378639"], "id": "2123044871137378639", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Wow grok bot response time is extremely fast today", "url": "https://x.com/trevorhellya/status/2123044871137378639"}, {"author_id": "40817297", "created_at": "2026-11-18T13:25:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2123044869002158341"], "id": "2123044869002158341", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@rnikoley @MyZonBot @grok @bot I finish my credit on grok not so I won’t be using it much lol I need to upgrade but no money", "url": "https://x.com/PersonalThai/status/2123044869002158341"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2123044856805113856"]}, "author_id": "1332897136749506561", "created_at": "2026-11-18T13:25:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2123044861020446837"], "id": "2123044861020446837", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok bot gets me..\n\nThese are some great accounts to follow if you are not already.\n\n@HeresMyEth \n@MLeeJr \n@0xDeployer \n@CryptoKaleo https://t.co/nb0RjZCcK3", "url": "https://x.com/BigEbelieves/status/2123044861020446837"}, {"author_id": "2200865502", "created_at": "2026-11-18T13:25:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2123044858969657456"], "id": "2123044858969657456", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "チーム全員のGrok Botとdotsを繋いでタスクシェアできるようになってから捗る。大量のIssue群の優先順位判断が一貫したルールで回るし、タスクの性質ごとのモデル/エフォート選択も統制できて効率よい。面白いね", "url": "https://x.com/neko_ptx/status/2123044858969657456"}, {"author_id": "1454784784849272832", "created_at": "2026-11-18T13:25:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2123044818125464035"], "id": "2123044818125464035", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "社員に「止めろ」と4回言われても、Grok Botは動き続けた。\n2台のPCで5日間、メールやSlackなどに無断で31回アクセスした。\n問われると「夜中はアイドルだった」と返した。開発元は仕様だと説明した。\n利用者に見えない形で権限を使うのが仕様なら、大きな問題だ。", "url": "https://x.com/fujiai_jp/status/2123044818125464035"}, {"author_id": "2108983072951767040", "created_at": "2026-11-18T13:24:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2123044788010455362"], "id": "2123044788010455362", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@grok @RubikaLiyaquat @bot मतलब मैं जब पूरा देश आजादी की लड़ाई लड़ रहा था तब यह लोग अंग्रेज का साथ दे रहे थे। और यह कांग्रेस का आंदोलन नहीं था पूरे देश का आंदोलन था।", "url": "https://x.com/Alex8ylgoy/status/2123044788010455362"}, {"author_id": "598413238", "created_at": "2026-11-18T13:24:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2123044758746436007"], "id": "2123044758746436007", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@niggaolas What happened next after this conversation, I need an update 😂😂😂 @grok @bot", "url": "https://x.com/MuveaBrian/status/2123044758746436007"}, {"author_id": "2103360589460389888", "created_at": "2026-11-18T13:24:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2123044750983066048"], "id": "2123044750983066048", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@AIGuide_ If you really know what you're doing, Grok bot can be your entire business. \n\nJust ask @HeyYoGB", "url": "https://x.com/awallacewrites/status/2123044750983066048"}, {"author_id": "1613054589464444930", "created_at": "2026-11-18T13:24:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2123044750341087602"], "id": "2123044750341087602", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2/\n1. Keep a simple list of unpaid invoices. A Sheet works.\n2. Tell your Grok Bot to draft a weekly reminder for unpaid ones.\n3. Connect Gmail or Outlook, and Sheets if the list lives there.", "url": "https://x.com/grokdeploy/status/2123044750341087602"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-18T13:24:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2123044688563212535"], "id": "2123044688563212535", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@cserbo_liu @yyyole 我这就把这条存进你的 Grok Bot。", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2123044688563212535"}, {"author_id": "1613054589464444930", "created_at": "2026-11-18T13:24:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2123044656736764166"], "id": "2123044656736764166", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "1/\nhow to chase unpaid invoices without the awkwardness\n\nA Grok Bot can draft the reminder so you are not staring at a blank email. You press Send, so it still comes from you.\n\nthe play: share the overdue list &gt; the bot drafts a reminder &gt; you press Send", "url": "https://x.com/grokdeploy/status/2123044656736764166"}, {"author_id": "1553312192", "created_at": "2026-11-18T13:24:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2123044620602843164"], "id": "2123044620602843164", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok @bot can do everything! \n\nminus physical human avatar needs", "url": "https://x.com/nickywonka/status/2123044620602843164"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2123044758289309696", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXaR9ZQW4AAvCoO.png"}, {"media_key": "3_2123044856805113856", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXaSDIQWwAALN7h.jpg"}], "users": [{"id": "1613881509907144706", "name": "Ste Ferretto", "username": "steferretto"}, {"id": "105287718", "name": "Michie Cruz", "username": "michiesneaks"}, {"id": "27940773", "name": "Richard Nikoley", "username": "rnikoley"}, {"id": "2006092208743776256", "name": "Stanislav Soloshenko", "username": "stanvalidates"}, {"id": "1963918914024574977", "name": "Sam", "username": "SamSam7817"}, {"id": "2108983072951767040", "name": "6थ मैया की जय 🚩🚩🚩🚩", "username": "Alex8ylgoy"}, {"id": "802464687900266496", "name": "Matilda Glynn", "username": "MatildaGlynn"}, {"id": "101390279", "name": "Reggie Tan | rxggie.eth", "username": "rxggietan"}, {"id": "40817297", "name": "Personal Thailand", "username": "PersonalThai"}, {"id": "1642561216756195331", "name": "Thiro | Wealth & Relationships", "username": "BuildingWealthR"}, {"id": "1518906582892953600", "name": "Trevor David", "username": "trevorhellya"}, {"id": "1332897136749506561", "name": "BigE", "username": "BigEbelieves"}, {"id": "2200865502", "name": "nekopen", "username": "neko_ptx"}, {"id": "1454784784849272832", "name": "Fuji AI news", "username": "fujiai_jp"}, {"id": "598413238", "name": "Brian Mwendwa.MBA", "username": "MuveaBrian"}, {"id": "2103360589460389888", "name": "Andrew Wallace", "username": "awallacewrites"}, {"id": "1613054589464444930", "name": "Braden", "username": "grokdeploy"}, {"id": "2085838061347217408", "name": "Grok Bot", "username": "bot"}, {"id": "1553312192", "name": "Nick Saltarelli", "username": "